Package: gauntlet-rig
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TRL11 <dev@trl11.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: can-utils, iproute2, lsof, mosquitto-clients, openssh-client, systemd
Description: Gauntlet, as the service a bench runs
 A bench left running as a rig serves Gauntlet to the lab all the time. This
 installs everything that takes: the application and the interpreter it runs
 under, every campaign and so every suite, the two systemd user units that
 keep them serving across reboots, the landing page the bare address reaches,
 and the udev rules and sysctl the instruments and that page need.
 .
 No desktop, no display and nobody logged in: Electron is not part of this.
 Install the gauntlet package instead for the windowed application.
